{
  "id": "FIN-CLIENT-LOCAL-STORE",
  "title": "客户端本地持久化存储卡号/CVV/口令等支付敏感信息",
  "severity": "high",
  "source": "《个人金融信息保护技术规范》（JR/T 0171—2020）6.1.3 d) —— 受理终端、个人终端及客户端应用软件均不应存储支付敏感信息及生物识别信息样本或模板",
  "advice": "客户端的 SharedPreferences、MMKV、UserDefaults 和 localStorage 都是明文或弱保护存储，卸载重装、root、越狱都能读。这里命中说明 key 是卡号、CVV、口令一类，应改成只存服务端下发的 token 或掩码后四位；确实要留凭证请用 Keychain/Keystore 并限制访问级别。生物识别只存「已开启」开关，不存特征样本或模板。",
  "check": {
    "type": "file-pattern",
    "pattern": "^(?!.*(?:Keychain|kSecClass|access_token|accessToken|\\*{4}|mask|Mask|后四位|biometric|Biometric))(?:(?:.*\\bputString\\(\\s*\"[^\"\\n]*?(?:card(?:number|_number|no|_no)?|cvv2?|cvn2?|pan|password|passwd|pwd|pin|track[_-]?[12])(?![a-z]))|(?:.*setObject:[^\\n]*forKey:@\"[^\"\\n]*?(?:cardNo|cardNumber|cvv|pan|password|passwd|pwd|pin)(?![a-z]))|(?:.*localStorage\\.setItem\\([^\\n]*?(?:card|cvv|pan|password|passwd|pwd|pin)(?![a-z]))|(?:.*\\b(?:SharedPreferences|MMKV|UserDefaults)[^\\n]*?(?:card|cvv|pan|password|passwd|pwd|pin)(?![a-z])))",
    "flags": "gi",
    "exts": [".kt", ".kts", ".java", ".swift", ".m", ".mm", ".dart", ".js", ".mjs", ".cjs", ".ts", ".jsx", ".tsx", ".vue", ".cs", ".php", ".xml"],
    "when": "putString|SharedPreferences|localStorage|UserDefaults|MMKV|setObject|getSharedPreferences",
    "max": 20
  }
}
